        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Beverly D'Angelo, Sissy Spacek, Thom Eberhardt, Patsy Cline\n- Films: The River Rat, Coal Miner's Daughter\n- Awards: Golden Globe Award, Academy Award for Best Actress\n\nFacts:\n- Thom Eberhardt directed the film The River Rat.\n- Thom Eberhardt also created the film Coal Miner's Daughter.\n- In Coal Miner's Daughter, Beverly D'Angelo was nominated for a Golden Globe Award for her role as Patsy Cline.\n- Sissy Spacek won the Academy Award for Best Actress for Coal Miner's Daughter.",
